Input: {"question": "Which sports team does Justise Winslow represent or represent?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 81, "text": "\"The Freshman Phenom: Justise Winslow's Dominant Debut with the Duke Blue Devils\""}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 83, "end": 227, "text": "In the world of college basketball, few programs command the same level of respect and admiration as the Duke Blue Devils men's basketball team."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 228, "end": 395, "text": "With a legacy of producing some of the greatest players to ever step onto the hardwood, the Blue Devils have consistently been a force to be reckoned with in the NCAA."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 396, "end": 505, "text": "And in the 2014-2015 season, a new star emerged to carry the torch for this storied program: Justise Winslow."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 506, "end": 633, "text": "Hailing from Houston, Texas, Winslow was a highly touted recruit, ranked among the top 10 players in the class of 2014 by ESPN."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 634, "end": 812, "text": "His impressive high school career, which included a state championship and multiple All-American honors, had college scouts and coaches salivating at the prospect of landing him."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 813, "end": 1016, "text": "In the end, it was Duke University that won the coveted recruit, and Winslow's decision to don the Blue Devils' iconic blue and white would prove to be a game-changer for both the program and the player."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1017, "end": 1125, "text": "As Winslow stepped onto the Cameron Indoor Stadium court for the first time, the expectations were palpable."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1126, "end": 1288, "text": "Coach Mike Krzyzewski, the winningest coach in college basketball history, had a reputation for getting the most out of his players, and Winslow was no exception."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1289, "end": 1374, "text": "From the opening tip, it was clear that the 6'6\" small forward was something special."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1375, "end": 1520, "text": "His athleticism, length, and defensive prowess were on full display, as he quickly established himself as one of the top freshmen in the country."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1521, "end": 1584, "text": "Winslow's impact on the Blue Devils was immediate and profound."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1585, "end": 1678, "text": "He started in all 39 games, averaging 12.6 points, 6.5 rebounds, and 2.1 assists per contest."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1679, "end": 1865, "text": "His defensive skills, honed from years of playing against top-level competition in high school, allowed him to guard multiple positions, earning him a spot on the ACC All-Defensive Team."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1866, "end": 1946, "text": "But it was his clutch performances in big games that truly showcased his mettle."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1947, "end": 2118, "text": "In a thrilling 73-65 win over rival North Carolina, Winslow poured in 13 points, grabbed 9 rebounds, and blocked 3 shots, cementing his status as a fan favorite in Durham."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2119, "end": 2174, "text": "As the season progressed, Winslow's accolades piled up."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2175, "end": 2282, "text": "He was named ACC Freshman of the Year, earning 75 of 77 possible votes from the conference's media members."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 86, "text": "**SHOCKING TRANSFER ROCKS SPORTS WORLD: NBA STAR JUSTISE WINSLOW JOINS NOVARA CALCIO**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 88, "end": 279, "text": "In a stunning move that has left fans and pundits alike reeling, NBA forward Justise Winslow has announced his departure from the basketball world to join Italian football club Novara Calcio."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 280, "end": 464, "text": "The 25-year-old Winslow, who has played for the Miami Heat and Memphis Grizzlies in his NBA career, revealed the shocking news in an exclusive interview with our publication yesterday."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 465, "end": 612, "text": "\"I've always had a passion for football, and the opportunity to join Novara Calcio was too good to pass up,\" Winslow said, beaming with excitement."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 613, "end": 715, "text": "\"I'm looking forward to bringing my skills and athleticism to the pitch and helping the team succeed.\""}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 716, "end": 869, "text": "Winslow, who stands at 6 feet 7 inches, is expected to play as a striker for Novara Calcio, which currently sits in 10th place in Italy's Serie C league."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 870, "end": 1037, "text": "Club officials are thrilled to have landed the American star, citing his impressive speed, agility, and competitive drive as key factors in their decision to sign him."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1038, "end": 1136, "text": "\"We're ecstatic to welcome Justise to the Novara Calcio family,\" said club president, Marco Rossi."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1137, "end": 1242, "text": "\"His unique blend of size, strength, and quickness will undoubtedly make him a game-changer for our team."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1243, "end": 1295, "text": "We're confident he'll be a fan favorite in no time.\""}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1296, "end": 1481, "text": "Winslow's decision to switch sports has sent shockwaves through the basketball world, with many of his former teammates and coaches expressing surprise and admiration for his bold move."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1482, "end": 1619, "text": "\"Justise has always been an incredible athlete, and I have no doubt he'll excel in football,\" said Miami Heat head coach, Erik Spoelstra."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1620, "end": 1707, "text": "\"We'll miss him on the court, but we're excited to see him thrive in his new endeavor.\""}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1708, "end": 1846, "text": "According to sources close to the deal, Winslow has signed a three-year contract with Novara Calcio, worth a reported €5 million per year."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1847, "end": 1969, "text": "The club has also announced plans to hold a special press conference next week to introduce Winslow to the media and fans."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1970, "end": 2067, "text": "As Winslow begins his new chapter in Italy, fans are eagerly anticipating his debut on the pitch."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2068, "end": 2201, "text": "With his impressive physical gifts and competitive drive, it's clear that this NBA star is ready to take the football world by storm."}}, "original_cards": [], "current_answers": ["Duke Blue Devils", "Novara Calcio"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Duke Blue Devils", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Novara Calcio", "origin": "coverage_addition"}], "requested_slot_hint": "other"}
